      "value": "@{60651324fbe2815d2b9ff6cb|full_name}, but if the issue happens on both branches, that implies the issues was there before the Unity-6 beta branch was made, and therefore the issue wasn't introduced as part of the Unity-6 update.\n\nIf the issue wasn't introduced in the Unity-6 beta update, the issue isn't related to the Open Beta bug report section, and should instead have been made in the normal Bug Report section.\n\nThat is all I am saying here.\n\nBut given the timing of the issue, and the fact that it is affecting both versions of the game, it is more likely a server-side issue recently introduced, or a regional ISP issue like we have seen many times before.",
