      "value": "Had this on every version of the game for like a month, it seems like it may happen more frequently (but not consistently) if you open the steamvr overlay while loading into the FIRST world of the session (this can be your homeworld or a world that you launched vrchat into directly) it never seems to happen past the first world load.",
