      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nI've been consistently having the problem the past week. Whenever I start the game I usually have to close and open VRChat 3-4 times over until it loads in and works as intended.\n\nStardox mentioning it the problems sounds similar since I am using SteamVR to VRChat and have close SteamVR completely and on again to try to have VRChat load in at times.\n\nI'll continue looking into it. I'll try to grab my logs when it comes up again.",
